## Java 코드

```java
public static int g(int x){
    if (x < 10) 
    return 10;
    else 
    return g(x / 10) + (x % 10);
}

public static int f(int a, int b) {
    int c = 1;
    while (b-- > 0) c *= a;
    return g(c);
}

public static void main(String[] args) {
    System.out.print(f(2, 5));
}
```

## JavaScript 코드
```JavaScript
function g(x) {
    return 10 < x ? g(parseInt(x / 10)) + x % 10 : 10;
}

function f(a, b) {
    let c = 1;
    while (b) {
        c *= a;
        b -= 1;
    }
    return g(c);
}

console.log(f(2, 5));
```

